OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAMissing British trekker's body
OL,4,Afound in Pakistan
OL,5,
OL,6,FKhalid Iqbal, the area's deputy
OL,7,Fcommissioner, said police and
OL,8,Fvolunteers had been involved in a
OL,9,Fsearch for 30-year-old Harris and his
OL,10,Fbody was found on a path in a forest,
OL,11,Fadding "most probably he slipped and
OL,12,Ffell".
OL,14,FHe had been living in Pakistan's
OL,15,Fcapital Islamabad where he worked for
OL,16,Fglobal advisory company Adam Smith
OL,17,FInternational.
